THE PROGRAM KNOWN AS SRRHF OR UNIVERSAL FITTER IS AN OPEN SOURCE PYTHON CODE FOR MACHINE LEARNING/NEURAL NETWORK. IT IS THE FITTING PROGRAM THAT WILL BE USED FOR SPINN (NEURAL NETWORK PROGRAM). 
